  << /ActualText (A UX Designer \046 Researcher on the path toward Creative Technology\056 I\047ve explored fragments of different paths along the way\054 with each field shaping the way I think through systems\054 patterns\054 and logic before eventually leading me to design\056 Interested in the intention beneath surface aesthetics\054 not only how things look\054 but how people behave\054 how technologies evolve\054 and how interactions can feel more natural\054 thoughtful\054 and human\056\n\nExperienced in independently designing end\055to\055end user experiences\054 from research and interaction flows to prototyping and experimental exploration\056\240 Through repetition and hands\055on problem solving\054 I\047ve developed the ability to think through interaction flows systematically while balancing both user needs and business context\056)
